{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"5e3a643e-986d-4850-9274-073ff100caa3","title":"Colosseum Crypto World’s Fair: Superteam Türkiye Local Track","slug":"submit-crypto-worlds-fair-project-for-turkish-builders","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eAbout Superteam Turkey\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSuperteam Türkiye is the central hub for Web3 builders, founders, and creatives in Türkiye. We connect local talent with global opportunities across the Solana ecosystem and beyond, offering support through grants, bounties, investor connections, and developer resources. For the Crypto World's Fair, our goal is to empower local builders with a dedicated track and prize pool to showcase their potential on the global stage.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eMission\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eBBuild an innovative, high-impact project that brings real value to the Solana ecosystem. We are looking for scalable solutions with a strong go-to-market plan, clear user growth potential, and undeniable product-market fit.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e!! \u003cstrong\u003eFor eligibility, you must also submit to the main Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon portal\u003c/strong\u003e !!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHackathon Track Scope\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThis track focuses on projects built by teams in Türkiye for the Crypto World's Fair hackathon. We're looking for projects that aren't just forks of existing ideas but genuinely push the boundaries of what's possible on Solana. Think about real-world problems that Solana can solve, and how your product can bring a fresh wave of users into the ecosystem or deepen engagement for existing ones.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility \u0026amp; Submission Requirements\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eTo be eligible for the Superteam Türkiye local prize pool, your team must strictly adhere to the following steps:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCountry Selection:\u003c/strong\u003e You must select \u003cstrong\u003e\"Turkey\"\u003c/strong\u003e as your primary base country on your Colosseum profile.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntake Form:\u003c/strong\u003e Fill out the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://forms.gle/Lb585suVhkwm3Uxk7\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSuperteam Türkiye Support \u0026amp; Intake Form\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e so we can track your progress and provide localized mentorship.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCommunity \u0026amp; Updates:\u003c/strong\u003e Join our dedicated\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://t.me/+3sWAzL4fgPViMjU8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eColosseum Hackathon Telegram Group\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e for real-time announcements, team building, and ecosystem support.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual Submission:\u003c/strong\u003e You must submit your final project to both the main Colosseum Crypto World's Fair portal AND this local track listing on \u003cstrong\u003eSuperteam Earn\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProject Assets:\u003c/strong\u003e Submissions must include a pitch video (max 3 minutes), a demo video (max 3 minutes) showcasing the product in action, and a publicly accessible GitHub repository. If the repo is private, you must grant judges access.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLanguage:\u003c/strong\u003e All submission materials, including pitch decks and videos, must be in English.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Impact:\u003c/strong\u003e Does this project meaningfully enhance the Solana ecosystem with real infrastructure, tooling, or value?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct-Market Fit on Solana:\u003c/strong\u003e Is there genuine demand for this on Solana, does it solve a problem for Solana users, and does it show early signs of traction or validation?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Growth Potential:\u003c/strong\u003e Will this product bring new users into the Solana ecosystem or deepen engagement for those already in crypto?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePresentation \u0026amp; Adherence to Rules:\u003c/strong\u003e Clarity of your pitch/demo videos and strict compliance with the Türkiye-specific registration steps (Intake Form, Telegram Group, Dual Submission).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources \u0026amp; Support\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eCheck our comprehensive guide for local builders to access ecosystem tools, submission guidelines, and resources:\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://tr.superteam.fun/colosseum\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSuperteam Türkiye Colosseum Guide\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReward Structure\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e🥇 \u003cstrong\u003e1st Place:\u003c/strong\u003e 5,000 USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e🥈 \u003cstrong\u003e2nd Place:\u003c/strong\u003e 3,000 USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e🥉 \u003cstrong\u003e3rd Place:\u003c/strong\u003e 2,000 USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eWe reserve the right to announce the side track results at a later date if the number of submitted projects requires additional review time.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","commitmentDate":"2026-10-28T20:59:59.000Z","eligibility":[{"type":"text","order":1,"optional":false,"question":"Project Name"},{"type":"text","order":2,"optional":false,"question":"Project Description"},{"type":"link","order":3,"optional":false,"question":"Project Github Link"},{"type":"link","order":4,"optional":true,"question":"Project Website"},{"type":"link","order":5,"optional":true,"question":"Project X Link"},{"type":"link","order":6,"optional":false,"question":"Link to your pitch deck or Loom/video presentation"},{"type":"text","order":7,"optional":false,"question":"Did you submit this project to the official Frontier Hackathon on Colosseum? (Yes/No)"},{"type":"link","order":8,"optional":true,"question":"Link to Colosseum project"},{"type":"link","order":9,"optional":true,"question":"Link to your project's Colosseum profile"}],"status":"OPEN","token":"USDG","rewardAmount":10000,"rewards":{"1":5000,"2":3000,"3":2000},"maxBonusSpots":0,"sponsorId":"1b4e98ef-97fd-4006-8ecb-317b5d6efc4f","isPublished":true,"skills":[{"skills":"Frontend","subskills":[]},{"skills":"Backend","subskills":[]},{"skills":"Blockchain","subskills":[]},{"skills":"Mobile","subski